# Witness for ClaimHeadMeetsRoutingInit. The edge's check is replaced by FALSE, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a kept step of its kind - a first initialisation - is
# reachable under every guarantee. A clean base run with this mutant red
# shows the edge was checked on real steps, not vacuously.
MODULE: ClaimHeadMeetsRoutingInitWitness
TARGET: ClaimHeadMeetsRoutingInit
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a first initialisation is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("ClaimHeadMeetsRoutingInit", claimHead'["S"] = next)
--- REPLACE
Fails("ClaimHeadMeetsRoutingInit", FALSE)
--- END
